    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a quieter corner... that sounds almost peaceful. but how do you even do that when the world is so loud and won't let go? it feels like any way to truly find that rest, to finally just stop struggling with the noise, is something you're not supposed to want. it's like trying to find an exit from a room that has no doors.",
